{
  "key": 18355,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_OnlyChosenMayEnterTemple",
      "en_US": [
        "Only the chosen may enter\n",
        "the Snowpoint Temple.\r",
        "I’m sorry, but you will have to\n",
        "leave.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_OnlyChosenMayEnterTemple2",
      "en_US": [
        "Only the chosen may enter\n",
        "the Snowpoint Temple.\r",
        "I’m sorry, but you will have to\n",
        "leave."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_BuiltInAncientTimes",
      "en_US": [
        "The temple is said to have been\n",
        "built in ancient times.\r",
        "It pays homage to the Pokémon of rock,\n",
        "ice, and steel that shape the land.\r",
        "So it is told."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_LetThatPersonIn",
      "en_US": [
        "Candice: It’s OK!\n",
        "You can let that person in.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_EnjoyYourExploring",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard from Cynthia.\r",
        "You’re working on a Pokédex,\n",
        "aren’t you?\r",
        "There should be many rare Pokémon\n",
        "in the temple.\r",
        "Enjoy your exploring!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_TownIsFreezingCold",
      "en_US": [
        "Brrr... This snowbound town is always\n",
        "freezing cold.\r",
        "But the spirits of the Trainers and\n",
        "their Pokémon burn hot and bright.\r",
        "Especially the Gym Leader."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_ScarfLooksWarm",
      "en_US": [
        "Your scarf looks nice and warm.\n",
        "I wish I had one like it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_IWantToLookAroundTemple",
      "en_US": [
        "I want to take a look around in the\n",
        "Snowpoint Temple.\r",
        "But only really tough Trainers are\n",
        "allowed inside."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_PokemonDraggedCityHere",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon are said to have dragged\n",
        "Snowpoint City here.\r",
        "The Snowpoint Temple is their resting\n",
        "place, they say."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_CandiceIsTeachingMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Candice is teaching me about Pokémon.\r",
        "She says I have to start by making\n",
        "friends with Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SailToBattleZone",
      "en_US": [
        "What is it? Do you want to sail\n",
        "to the Battle Zone?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_LetsSetSail",
      "en_US": [
        "Aye, aye, then!\n",
        "Let’s set sail!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_YouCantGoUsingSurf",
      "en_US": [
        "What is it?\n",
        "The Battle Zone’s rough to get to.\r",
        "The sea around it is always roiling\n",
        "with choppy waves.\r",
        "You can’t go there using Surf,\n",
        "that’s for sure."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_ILookForwardToAGreatTrainer",
      "en_US": [
        "A great Trainer recognized by\n",
        "the Pokémon League...\r",
        "I look forward to carrying someone\n",
        "like that on this ship!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_NothingExceptionalHere",
      "en_US": [
        "There is nothing exceptional here.\n",
        "That makes Snowpoint unique.\r",
        "There’s nothing exceptional about me.\n",
        "That’s what makes me stand out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_ImGladIWaited",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: I thought you would come.\n",
        "I’m glad I waited for you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_GoodThatOurWorldChanges",
      "en_US": [
        "Cynthia: I think it’s good that our\n",
        "world is constantly changing.\r",
        "Of course, I don’t want it to become\n",
        "what only one person wants.\r",
        "A world like Cyrus envisions...\n",
        "No one would want that.\r",
        "The kind of world I want to see is where\n",
        "everyone can share their joy.\r",
        "Where Pokémon and the people around\n",
        "them can be happy for each other.\r",
        "I want the world to become a place\n",
        "where everyone is smiling.\r",
        "The world could be so much better\n",
        "if we all tried to make it that way.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_TravelToFarOffPlaces",
      "en_US": [
        "I want you to keep traveling to many\n",
        "far-off places.\r",
        "I want you to keep meeting all kinds of\n",
        "people and Pokémon.\r",
        "I came all the way here just so I could\n",
        "say that to you.\r",
        "Your horizons will expand again if you\n",
        "visit the Fight Area as well.\r",
        "I hope our paths cross again!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_MapSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Snowpoint City\n",
        "City of Snow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SignPokemonGym",
      "en_US": [
        "Snowpoint City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Candice\f",
        "The Diamond Dust Girl!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignIceMasterIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Ice-type Master!\n",
        "I aim to find the ultimate Ice-type!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignIceMasterFail",
      "en_US": [
        "Come at me with only a {COLOR 1}single Pokémon{COLOR 0}\n",
        "in your party if you want to battle me.\r",
        "Oh, and there’s one other condition...\n",
        "That Pokémon must be an {COLOR 1}Ice-type{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignIceMasterAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Ice-type looks pretty strong!\r",
        "Should we find out who has the\n",
        "ultimate Ice-type Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignIceMasterBattle",
      "en_US": "Time for an Ice-type battle!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignIceMasterWin",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, wow.\r",
        "It seems the ultimate Ice-type\n",
        "Pokémon belongs to you!\r",
        "That means you are the rightful owner\n",
        "of this precious item!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignIceMasterLose",
      "en_US": [
        "The ultimate Ice-type Pokémon\n",
        "belongs to me!\r",
        "But I’m always ready for another\n",
        "Ice-type battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignIceMasterThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for a great Ice-type\n",
        "Pokémon battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignIceMasterDecline",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\n",
        "Do you feel like you can’t win?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignGymGuide",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to Snowpoint, Champ-to-be!\n",
        "It’s chilly, but it’s a sight to see.\r",
        "You’ve probably noticed the tremors\n",
        "happening around the city, right?\r",
        "Snowpoint’s Gym Leader is currently\n",
        "dealing with the source of them.\r",
        "The Gym Leaders in Sinnoh sure are a\n",
        "busy bunch, huh?\r",
        "Candice went to the Snowpoint Temple,\n",
        "located at the north end of the city.\r",
        "You’re welcome to go look for her if\n",
        "you’re desperate to get your Badge.\r",
        "But... don’t get too relaxed.\n",
        "Access to the temple  is restricted.\r",
        "You won’t be allowed to enter unless\n",
        "you prove your strength!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignTremorsFreezingCold",
      "en_US": [
        "Brrr... This snowbound town is always\n",
        "freezing cold.\r",
        "But these tremors... They’re abnormal.\n",
        "It’s honestly very strange."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignTremorsExceptional",
      "en_US": [
        "There is nothing exceptional here.\n",
        "Well, normally...\r",
        "But these earthquakes keep happening!\n",
        "It’s making the city stand out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignTremorsTemple",
      "en_US": [
        "I want to take a look around in the\n",
        "Snowpoint Temple.\r",
        "But it’s off-limits to civilians right\n",
        "now because of these tremors.\r",
        "But even then, they usually only\n",
        "allow strong Trainers to enter."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignTremorsCandice",
      "en_US": [
        "Candice is teaching me about Pokémon.\r",
        "You know, she went to Snowpoint Temple\n",
        "to try and stop these tremors.\r",
        "She’s an amazing person, right?\n",
        "I’m glad to have her as a teacher."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignTremorsScarf",
      "en_US": [
        "Your scarf looks nice and warm...\r",
        "You were expecting a cosy walk in\n",
        "this snowy town, right?\r",
        "On a normal day, it’s very pleasant.\r",
        "But because the ground is shaking,\n",
        "it isn’t very appealing right now...\r",
        "They’re saying something is up with a\n",
        "Pokémon that sleeps inside the temple."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignGuardsChallenge",
      "en_US": [
        "Only the strong may enter the\n",
        "Snowpoint Temple.\r",
        "Do you wish to prove your strength\n",
        "to us in a battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignGuardsBegin",
      "en_US": [
        "Very well.\n",
        "Let the battle begin.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignGuardsYouMayEnter",
      "en_US": [
        "You are indeed strong.\n",
        "Then you may enter.\r",
        "We would be grateful if you could\n",
        "assist with handling the chaos in the\f",
        "basement of the temple.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SnowpointCity_Text_SovereignGuardsNeedTwo",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\n",
        "You only have one Pokémon.\r",
        "I’m sorry, but you’ll need at least\n",
        "two Pokémon to battle us."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
